<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 04:35:53 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>霍尔木兹海峡危机威胁亚洲石油和天然气生命线。以下是该地区如何重写其能源策略</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/iran-war-hormuz-blocked-asia-energy-crisis-oil-gas/</link><description>“尽管过去十年替代和绿色技术兴起，但全球经济仍然非常依赖石油和天然气。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2282682906.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/iran-war-hormuz-blocked-asia-energy-crisis-oil-gas/</guid></item><item><title>在高油价和原油库存萎缩的情况下，特朗普称美国将控制委内瑞拉650亿桶石油储备</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/trump-us-control-65-billion-barrels-venezuelan-oil-reserves/</link><description>委内瑞拉是世界上石油储量最大的国家之一，地下原油储量估计为 3030 亿桶。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26240757900206-e1787959468995.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 23:29:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/trump-us-control-65-billion-barrels-venezuelan-oil-reserves/</guid></item><item><title>凯文·沃什 (Kevin Warsh) 最终向华尔街抛出了他的想法：“有一个信号是任何人都不能错过的：65 个月的通胀加剧”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/kevin-warsh-jackson-hole-clarity-inflation-employment-mandate/</link><description>但请不要误会：“我们不应该沉迷于市场参与者主要指望美联储进行下一笔交易的制度。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291777436-e1787930037524.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 15:33:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/kevin-warsh-jackson-hole-clarity-inflation-employment-mandate/</guid></item><item><title>司法部正在诉诸古老的法律来扣押伊朗油轮。美国已经很久没有使用它了，“我们必须举行降神会”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/justice-department-maritime-prize-law-centuries-old-iranian-oil-tankers/</link><description>司法部正在恢复奖励法，这是一套具有数百年历史的规则，可以简化扣押敌方船只的过程。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2269572147-e1787946894609.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:10:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/justice-department-maritime-prize-law-centuries-old-iranian-oil-tankers/</guid></item><item><title>Meta 的 170 亿美元青少年安全和解协议实际上是 1% 的税，而且是 TikTok 和 YouTube 中的一个游戏</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/metas-17-billion-teen-safety-settlement-is-really-a-1-tax-and-a-play-to-box-in-tiktok-and-youtube/</link><description>更深层次的教训是，产品设计作为法律责任的场所，是一种可行的法律策略。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281617231-e1787951229149.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 21:08:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/metas-17-billion-teen-safety-settlement-is-really-a-1-tax-and-a-play-to-box-in-tiktok-and-youtube/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 很可能在同一天写下了她最热门的两首歌曲</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/dolly-parton-three-greatest-songs-jolene-love-you-9-to-5/</link><description>三首歌比其他任何歌曲都更能体现多莉·帕顿的天才。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-57000913.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:58:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/dolly-parton-three-greatest-songs-jolene-love-you-9-to-5/</guid></item><item><title>纽约市又发送了 11,000 封临时住所纳税信函，向因未检查 2025 年纳税申报表而被错误发送的 1,200 封信函道歉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/new-york-city-more-pied-a-terre-tax-letters-2025-returns/</link><description>纽约市市长 Zohran Mamdani 在发出 17,000 封警告信之前承认该市缺乏 2025 年税务数据。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290193702-e1787935294649.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 18:14:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/new-york-city-more-pied-a-terre-tax-letters-2025-returns/</guid></item><item><title>“就像在麦当劳一样”：美国缉毒局调查发现，体育护士向运动员出售阿片类药物，比如“你必须为你的汉堡付钱”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/sports-nurse-drugs-opiods-athletes-dea/</link><description>琼·鲁宾格 (Joan Rubinger) 的客户名单包括数百名运动员，但美国缉毒局发现她发放了数千张非法处方药。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2186872045-e1787944049115.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:30:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/sports-nurse-drugs-opiods-athletes-dea/</guid></item><item><title>“我们有工作要做”：美联储主席沃什建议在高通胀的情况下未来几个月加息</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/federal-reserve-chair-kevin-warsh-raising-interest-rate/</link><description>沃什表示，最近有关通胀下降的报告并没有告诉他“基本趋势已经显着改善”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288203975_add812-e1787942339560.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:30:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/federal-reserve-chair-kevin-warsh-raising-interest-rate/</guid></item><item><title>耐克带回了一位 32 年的老将来拯救这个 $60B 的品牌。两年后，其扭亏为盈仍然是一个“漫长而艰难的过程”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/nike-ceo-veteran-elliott-hill-turnaround-growth/</link><description>首席执行官埃利奥特·希尔已开始整顿耐克的业务。赢回失去的消费者和文化声誉可能要困难得多。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2260535597.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 07:05:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/nike-ceo-veteran-elliott-hill-turnaround-growth/</guid></item></channel></rss>